    },
    "Without Cumulus Pro, Cumulus follows your first account only. Nothing is erased: this account’s key, builds and settings are intact, and its sync starts again with Pro." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sans Cumulus Pro, Cumulus ne suit que votre premier compte. Rien n’est effacé : la clé, les builds et les réglages de ce compte sont intacts, et sa synchronisation reprend avec Pro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it, only `cumulus status` answers; the other commands and every MCP tool say that Cumulus Pro is required. What is installed here stays in place." : {
      "localizations" : {
